### Remaining Limitations
- **Verification on actual git repos**: In line with sandbox constraints, tests only exercise non-git or invalid repository paths where `gitInfo` correctly returns `null`. Verification of git repository outputs (i.e. returning a valid object with `{ branch, statusShort }`) relies on the caller executing the probe inside a valid git repository at user runtime.
